Analyze recent financial headlines, focusing on both positive and negative economic indicators released since Monday's open. Compare current S&P 500 performance against that opening price. Calculate the percentage difference. Factor in upcoming Federal Reserve announcements (if any) and their projected impact. If the news flow is overwhelmingly positive and the S&P 500 is moderately up (between 0.5% and 1.5%), assign a sentiment reflecting further upside. If news is mixed, temper the sentiment and reduce conviction. Output JSON.